# Website Screenshot Tool

A simple Python tool that captures full-page screenshots of websites using Playwright.

## Features

* Accepts any website URL
* Automatically adds `https://` when needed
* Captures full-page screenshots
* Saves screenshots automatically in the `screenshots` folder
* Handles loading errors and timeouts

## Tech Used

* Python
* Playwright

## Run

```bash
python main.py
```

Enter the website URL when prompted. The screenshot will be saved inside the `screenshots` folder.
